      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new instance of <a href=\"ParseState.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.parsing\"><code>ParseState</code></a> which is an independent snapshot\nof this instance.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"ParseState.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.parsing\"><code>ParseState</code></a>实例，它是此实例的独立快照。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Calling <a href=\"#toString()\"><code>toString()</code></a> will render a tree-style view of the current logical\nposition in the parse phase. This representation is intended for use in error messages.",
      "translation": "调用 `<a href=\"#toString()\"><code>toString()</code></a>` 将渲染当前解析阶段逻辑位置的树形视图。此表示形式旨在用于错误消息中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>ParseState</code> with an empty <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/ArrayDeque.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>ArrayDeque</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<code>ParseState</code>，其包含一个空的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/ArrayDeque.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>ArrayDeque</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a tree-style representation of the current <code>ParseState</code>.",
      "translation": "返回当前<code>ParseState</code>的树形表示。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
